## 6. 链序装填

- 参考题目题号: 18, 19, 17
- tags:
  - operation:排序, sort
  - operation:计数, counting
  - operation:填充, fill
  - operation:裁剪, crop
  - object:条纹, stripe
  - object:端帽像素, cap_pixel
  - object:正方形区域, square_region
